# ROOFCAT: down + A drops through a one-way ledge, a tier at a time; on a
# solid roof it is just a jump. (Screen 5: ledges at rows 2 and 6 above the
# roof at row 8.)
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat cam 1600
cheat clear_foes
cheat put 140 10
wait 20
expect grounded == 1
expect py == 19
hold DOWN A 3
wait 40
expect py == 83
expect grounded == 1
hold DOWN A 3
wait 40
expect py == 115
expect grounded == 1
hold DOWN A 3
wait 4
expect grounded == 0
expect py < 115
